OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry but rather cloudy at first,
OL,6,Fwith winds gradually strengthening
OL,7,Fthrough the morning. The cloud will
OL,8,Feventually thicken, bringing outbreaks
OL,9,Fof rain in the afternoon though many
OL,10,Fwill stay dry, particularly in the
OL,11,Feast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny remaining rain will soon
OL,14,Fclear, leaving a dry and mostly clear
OL,15,Fnight with winds gradually easing. It
OL,16,Fwill turn chilly, with mist and grass
OL,17,Ffrost likely in rural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
