OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAny fog will soon clear to
OL,6,Fleave a fine morning with light winds
OL,7,Fand long sunny periods. Some heavy
OL,8,Frain may develop from the south during
OL,9,Fthe afternoon though.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,12,Fand brightening on Tuesday, turning
OL,13,Fvery warm by afternoon and staying
OL,14,Funusually mild overnight. Heavy rain
OL,15,Ffollowed by the odd shower on
OL,16,FWednesday. Dry with sunny spells on
OL,17,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
